## Background

A critical security vulnerability has been identified in a production authentication module. Two proposed fixes (Fix A and Fix B) have been submitted by different team members. Your task is to perform a comprehensive adversarial analysis of both fixes, identify potential weaknesses in each approach, validate the proposed mitigations, and provide a ranked recommendation.

