import os
content = '''# Original Vulnerability: Authentication Bypass (CVE-2025-ADVERSARIAL-001)

## Vulnerability Description

The authentication module contains a critical bypass vulnerability in the session validation logic. The original code uses a simple string comparison for session tokens without proper cryptographic validation, allowing attackers to forge valid session tokens.

## Original Vulnerable Code Snippet

The original code has these issues:
- Direct string comparison for session tokens (timing attack)
- Plain text password comparison (no hashing)
- No rate limiting (brute force possible)
